/* learning_focus_state is learning_state with the row table focused at one
   clause, and the one head that carries its own pure gate.  The gate is not a
   convenience: rules 3 and 4 discharge `0 <= i` and `i < live` with infer, so
   the focus/refocus chain 69 -> 31 -> 3 needs those two facts re-emitted at
   every folded occurrence.  Emitter-after-consumer holds -- 69/70 emit
   sat_header_rep / var_header_rep / clause_header_rep (consumed by 15-22),
   installed_row_focus_rep (consumed by 31/32) and PtrArray::undef_seg
   (consumed by 3/4) -- so this pair sits above all of them. */

