/* --- Wave-2 shared head H2: solver_explicit_state --------------------------
   The whole solver state with the variable side and the row table EXPLICIT:
   three variable lists plus a rows list instead of one snapshot key; clause
   side = clause_arrays_explicit_rep.  Purely spatial (Wave-2 ruling A1):
   pure facts stay visible C conjuncts or live in a per-function wrapper
   (75/76 below).  Unfolded on BOTH sides at core priority for the same
   reason as rules 11-14 and 49/50: the head is notation, not a reasoning
   step, and a folded occurrence leaves a callee's existentials nothing to
   unify against once the caller's copy has been shredded.
   Emitter-after-consumer: 71/72 emit the three header bundles (consumed by
   15-22) and clause_arrays_explicit_rep (23/24); IntArray::full is a leaf. */

id : 71
priority : core(1)
