/* --- backtrack's thin wrapper over H2 --------------------------------------
   backtrack_inner_state = the absorbed pure block of backtrack's two
   whole-table annotations && one solver_explicit_state instance keyed on
   current_snap, the cur_dl cell carrying back_dl.  The two
   variable-being-cleared facts are NOT here (ruling A4): they stay visible C
   lines in both blocks.  Per ruling A1 the wrapper re-emits every absorbed
   conjunct individually at core(1), plus the H2 head, which rules 71/72
   (lower ids) then shred. */

