   variable-side lists, the row table, the three clause-summary lists.
   Purely spatial by ruling A1 -- the pure facts of every site (including
   0 <= focus < live and any row-length bridge) stay visible C conjuncts or
   live in a per-function wrapper such as rules 77/78 below.

   Emitter-after-consumer holds: 73/74 emit the header trio (consumed by
   15-20), three IntArray::full leaves, clause_summaries_explicit_rep
   (29/30), installed_row_focus_rep (31/32) and a PtrArray::undef_seg
   leaf. */

id : 73
priority : core(1)
right : solver_row_focus_state(?s, ?values, ?reasons, ?levels, ?states,
          ?true_counts, ?unassigned, ?row_table, ?n, ?live, ?cap, ?dl,
